  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21463196",
      "title": "Introducing Computed Properties",
      "lectureOrder": 31,
      "videoOrder": 27,
      "sourceHash": "a1dd8f64faba6ff81e41c30f58d5a6c8f861b65ab79288d9fd2143f6cfa66169",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 5.4,
          "en": "Well, you could of course put your code in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.4,
          "end": 9.26,
          "en": "Name plus Schwartz Muller, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.26,
          "end": 10.99,
          "en": "you could put it in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.99,
          "end": 14.18,
          "en": "And if you do that, you avoid this problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.18,
          "end": 17.3,
          "en": "Now view is able to see what's getting used here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.3,
          "end": 19.61,
          "en": "and it will only updated this paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.61,
          "end": 22.106,
          "en": "and only reevaluated if well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.106,
          "end": 24.38,
          "en": "in this case name changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.38,
          "end": 26.5,
          "en": "and output full name has never called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.5,
          "end": 29.091,
          "en": "and therefore will never be called by view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.091,
          "end": 33.11,
          "en": "But now we have more logic in our HTML code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.11,
          "end": 36.32,
          "en": "and that's again, not good as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.32,
          "end": 38.63,
          "en": "So there is a third nice feature we can use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.63,
          "end": 40.193,
          "en": "computed properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.55,
          "end": 45.24,
          "en": "Computed properties are essentially like methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.24,
          "end": 48.61,
          "en": "with one important difference view will be aware",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.61,
          "end": 52.19,
          "en": "of their dependencies and only reexecute them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.19,
          "end": 54.453,
          "en": "if one of the dependencies changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.33,
          "end": 59.37,
          "en": "Computed is the third big configuration option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.37,
          "end": 62.64,
          "en": "we learn about for the app we created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.64,
          "end": 64.2,
          "en": "The first one was data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.2,
          "end": 65.85,
          "en": "The second one was methods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.85,
          "end": 67.87,
          "en": "The third one is computed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.87,
          "end": 70.56,
          "en": "You can add it anywhere in this conflict object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.56,
          "end": 73.77,
          "en": "here I will add it between data at methods,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.77,
          "end": 75.785,
          "en": "but the position doesn't matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.785,
          "end": 80.785,
          "en": "So you add computed here and just like methods and data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.95,
          "end": 83.24,
          "en": "This is not a name you can choose.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.24,
          "end": 84.83,
          "en": "That is a name you have to use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.83,
          "end": 87.6,
          "en": "because it's one of the key options,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.6,
          "end": 91.64,
          "en": "supported by view in view apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.64,
          "end": 95.62,
          "en": "Computed like methods wants an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.62,
          "end": 98.745,
          "en": "So you pass an object as a value to compute it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.745,
          "end": 101.07,
          "en": "And now in computed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.07,
          "end": 105.43,
          "en": "you define a bunch of methods just like in methods,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.43,
          "end": 108.86,
          "en": "but the methods you defined and computed will be called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.86,
          "end": 110.75999999999999,
          "en": "and executed differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.75999999999999,
          "end": 113.989,
          "en": "That's why we have these two different blocks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.989,
          "end": 118,
          "en": "So here we could add a full name method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118,
          "end": 122.25,
          "en": "and I'm naming it full name and not output full name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 124.81,
          "en": "even though I could, because that name is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.81,
          "end": 128.36,
          "en": "but I'm naming it like this because we're going to use this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.36,
          "end": 131.48,
          "en": "like a data property, not like a method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.48,
          "end": 133.57,
          "en": "even though technically it is a method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 133.57,
          "end": 135.53,
          "en": "but we're not going to use it as such.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.53,
          "end": 136.99,
          "en": "We're not going to call it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.99,
          "end": 140.45,
          "en": "And therefore you should name your computed properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 140.45,
          "end": 143.623,
          "en": "just as you would name your data properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.17000000000002,
          "end": 146.63,
          "en": "And now in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.63,
          "end": 150.76,
          "en": "we wanna return to value that eventually should be yielded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.76,
          "end": 152.63,
          "en": "by that computed property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.63,
          "end": 155.8,
          "en": "and there I'll just copy the exact same code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.8,
          "end": 158.7,
          "en": "I had in my output full name method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.7,
          "end": 162.36,
          "en": "So I'll copy that code and put that in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.36,
          "end": 165.89,
          "en": "And now, as I mentioned, we can use this full name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 165.89,
          "end": 170.7,
          "en": "computed property in our HTML code like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.7,
          "end": 171.96,
          "en": "And that's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.96,
          "end": 175.46,
          "en": "Not like this without parentheses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 175.46,
          "end": 177.01,
          "en": "you don't call it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 177.01,
          "end": 181.35,
          "en": "you just point at it and view we'll call it for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 181.35,
          "end": 185.01,
          "en": "We use it just like we use data properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.01,
          "end": 187.06,
          "en": "like to counter here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 187.06,
          "end": 190.87,
          "en": "And that's why we should also name our computed properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 190.87,
          "end": 192.32,
          "en": "like data properties,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 192.32,
          "end": 195.67,
          "en": "because we use them like properties like variables.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195.67,
          "end": 197.593,
          "en": "We don't use them like functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 198.79,
          "end": 201.3,
          "en": "So full name here will be connected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.3,
          "end": 203.46,
          "en": "to this full name computed property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 203.46,
          "end": 206.02,
          "en": "so the name of course has to be equal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 206.02,
          "end": 208.761,
          "en": "And now view will execute this for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 208.761,
          "end": 210.38,
          "en": "It will basically check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 210.38,
          "end": 212.59,
          "en": "if there is a full name data property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 212.59,
          "end": 214.26,
          "en": "And if there isn't, it will check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 214.26,
          "end": 216.94,
          "en": "If there may be as a computed property with the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 216.94,
          "end": 219.41,
          "en": "and if that's the case, it will execute it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 219.41,
          "end": 222.07,
          "en": "And hence, if I saved us here in reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 222.07,
          "end": 224.1,
          "en": "we see nothing here initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 224.1,
          "end": 225.98,
          "en": "But as soon as I start typing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 225.98,
          "end": 228.57,
          "en": "we see the full name show up again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 228.57,
          "end": 230.585,
          "en": "So we've got the same behavior as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 230.585,
          "end": 233.15,
          "en": "but now with one important difference,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 233.15,
          "end": 235.253,
          "en": "let's check the developer tools again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 236.68,
          "end": 238.77,
          "en": "In there If I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 238.77,
          "end": 243.25,
          "en": "you will notice running again once initially of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 243.25,
          "end": 247.02,
          "en": "because it needs to evaluate the value returned by full name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 247.02,
          "end": 249.923,
          "en": "when the app is first rendered to discreet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 250.788,
          "end": 255.13,
          "en": "But now if I cleared it, if I changed my counter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 255.13,
          "end": 258.45,
          "en": "we don't see running again and keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 258.45,
          "end": 260.45,
          "en": "that with a method, we did see it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 260.45,
          "end": 262.86,
          "en": "but now that's no longer the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 262.86,
          "end": 265.54,
          "en": "We only see it if we type here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 265.54,
          "end": 268.69,
          "en": "which makes a lot of sense because here we really changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 268.69,
          "end": 271.55,
          "en": "something that's being used in that computed property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 271.55,
          "end": 274.203,
          "en": "We change the name with every keystroke.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 274.203,
          "end": 277.03,
          "en": "So with computer properties,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 277.03,
          "end": 281.21,
          "en": "view is aware of the dependencies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 281.21,
          "end": 282.9,
          "en": "off the computer properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 282.9,
          "end": 286.46,
          "en": "So in this case, that name is a dependency",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 286.46,
          "end": 290.76,
          "en": "and it will cache the computed property value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 290.76,
          "end": 294.46,
          "en": "and only recalculate and reevaluate it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 294.46,
          "end": 296.94,
          "en": "if one of the dependencies in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 296.94,
          "end": 301.34,
          "en": "the only dependency we have the name property changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 301.34,
          "end": 304.41,
          "en": "And that's the key difference for performance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.41,
          "end": 308.17,
          "en": "It's better to use computer properties that methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 308.17,
          "end": 311.54,
          "en": "for outputting values In most cases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 311.54,
          "end": 315.82,
          "en": "only use methods if you know that you want to recalculate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 315.82,
          "end": 319.46,
          "en": "a value whenever anything on the page changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 319.46,
          "end": 322.3,
          "en": "In most scenarios, that will not be the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 322.3,
          "end": 325.659,
          "en": "You only want to recalculate a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 325.659,
          "end": 326.492,
          "en": "if a dependency changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 326.492,
          "end": 328.68,
          "en": "And that's when computed properties shine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 328.68,
          "end": 332.56,
          "en": "You still need methods either because you have something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 332.56,
          "end": 336.04,
          "en": "that you really want to reexecute whenever anything changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 336.04,
          "end": 339.86,
          "en": "or more often, because you have events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 339.86,
          "end": 343.45,
          "en": "and you wanna trigger certain methods when an event occurs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 343.45,
          "end": 345,
          "en": "that does not change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 345,
          "end": 347.49,
          "en": "You still bind your events to methods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 347.49,
          "end": 350.33,
          "en": "You don't bind events to computer properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 350.33,
          "end": 353.12,
          "en": "You really only use computer properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 353.12,
          "end": 356.453,
          "en": "for outputting something like here, the full name.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
